      "scenes": [
        {
          "audio": "I think there are three main advantages.",
          "label": "Opening Hook",
          "visual": "Static graphic display on a white background. At the top, three dark oval pills highlight three points. Below, two separate product interfaces are shown side-by-side: a web-based chat interface on the left and a dark-themed terminal interface on the right. A progress bar-like graphic sits at the bottom.",
          "shot_type": "Wide Shot",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "timestamp_end": "0:02",
          "timestamp_start": "0:00"
        },
        {
          "audio": "First, light and fast.",
          "label": "Product Selling Points",
          "visual": "A transition effect highlights the first point at the top. The background remains white. The two interface side-by-side views persist, with the left labeled as the desktop version and the right as the terminal version.",
          "shot_type": "Wide Shot",
          "scene_number": 2,
          "timestamp_end": "0:04",
          "timestamp_start": "0:02"
        },
        {
          "audio": "The desktop version is a complete piece of software. The interface, animations, and various windows all consume memory.",
          "label": "Product Information",
          "visual": "The left side (desktop version) expands with three layered white boxes representing different UI components. A circle graphic displays animated dots. The bottom bar under this section fills with a dark color to represent memory usage, becoming thicker and more prominent as more components are 'loaded' visually.",
          "shot_type": "Medium Shot",
          "scene_number": 3,
          "timestamp_end": "0:09",
          "timestamp_start": "0:04"
        },
        {
          "audio": "The terminal version is just a text window, which opens quickly.",
          "label": "Product Selling Points",
          "visual": "Focus shifts to the right side (terminal version). A single text box appears with a terminal prompt. The bottom progress bar for this section remains thin and mostly empty, contrasting with the heavy bar on the left side.",
          "shot_type": "Medium Shot",
          "scene_number": 4,
          "timestamp_end": "0:12",
          "timestamp_start": "0:09"
        },
        {
          "audio": "And I can open several windows at the same time to run tasks in parallel, which is easier and less likely to cause a memory explosion.",
          "label": "Usage Scenarios",
          "visual": "The terminal side populates with multiple overlapping dark terminal windows showing scrolling text. On the left, the desktop version shows a loading spinner. The right side appears dynamic and active while the left side remains static with a loading icon.",
          "shot_type": "Wide Shot",
          "scene_number": 5,
          "timestamp_end": "0:17",
          "timestamp_start": "0:12"
        }
      ]
